{"collection":{"version":"1.1","href":"http://images-api.nasa.gov/search?q=Mission+Control+Center+Gemini&media_type=image&year_start=1965&year_end=1966&page_size=25","items":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-45280/collection.json","data":[{"center":"JSC","date_created":"1965-08-21T00:00:00Z","description":"S65-45280 (21-29 Aug. 1965) --- Overall view of the Mission Control Center (MCC), Houston, Texas, during the Gemini-5 flight. Note the screen at the front of the MCC which is used to track the progress of the Gemini spacecraft.","keywords":["CONSOLES","FLIGHT CONTROL","GEMINI 5 FLIGHT","GEMINI PROJECT","GROUND BASED CONTROL","INTEGRATED MISSION CONTROL CENTER","PERSONNEL","TEXAS"],"media_type":"image","nasa_id":"s65-45280","title":"Overall view of Mission Control Center, Houston, Tx during Gemini 5"}],"links":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-45280/s65-45280~medium.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":1280,"size":115000,"height":549},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-45280/s65-45280~small.jpg","rel":"alternate","render":"image","width":640,"size":36000,"height":274},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-45280/s65-45280~thumb.jpg","rel":"preview","render":"image","width":640,"size":36000,"height":274},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-45280/s65-45280~orig.jpg","rel":"canonical","render":"image"}]},{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-18200/collection.json","data":[{"center":"JSC","date_created":"1965-03-23T00:00:00Z","description":"S65-18200 (23 March 1965) --- Overall view of the Mission Control Center at the Manned Spacecraft Center in Houston, Texas during the Gemini-Titan 3 flight.","keywords":["FLIGHT CONTROL","GEMINI (GT-3) SPACECRAFT"],"media_type":"image","nasa_id":"s65-18200","title":"MISSION CONTROL CENTER (MCC) - GEMINI-TITAN (GT)-3 ACTIVITY - MSC"}],"links":[{"href":"https://images-assets.nasa.gov/image/s65-18200/s65-18200~medium.jpg","rel":"alternate",